tft-core-client

This library speaks the extension protocol of Roon Labs' music software: SOOD
discovery, MOO messages over a WebSocket, and the registry, transport and browse
services. The protocol has no official specification. The behaviour implemented
here was learned by reading Roon Labs' own JavaScript client, node-roon-api
(https://github.com/RoonLabs/node-roon-api), which is licensed under the
Apache License 2.0, and by observing a Roon Core on a local network.

No source code from node-roon-api is included in or derived from this library;
all code here was written independently from the protocol description in
docs/PROTOCOL.md.

